  "releaseNotes": "`di-scan --fix` applies the rules' safe code fixes with `dotnet format` before scanning. | `di-scan --update-baseline <file>` writes the current findings as a text baseline; `--baseline` reads it back. | A Windows/macOS CI matrix exercises scanner path handling, package contents, and tool consumption. | Dedicated false-positive and false-negative issue forms, Dependabot updates, and CODEOWNERS.",
